  <Name>k__BackingField: Golem
  <Description>k__BackingField: 'The <b>Golem</b> is a masive heavy and durable armor driven by an elite pilot. He dominates the battlefield with devastating area damage from his <b>Titan Slam</b> and draws enemies into his kill zone with <b>Stomp</b>. Packing built-in synergy, his maximum health directly scales both his <b>Titan Slam</b> skill and healing capabilities. '
